# The noise layer: HOME's third page, Noise (Level, Type, Freq, Reso), off to start. Its level is a Mod
# destination, so breath can blow it in; it plays with the note and stops with it.
wait 200
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 2
expect par56 0
expect val2 BP
spin K2 -50
expect val2 LP
spin K2 25
expect val2 LP-BP
spin K2 25
expect par57 50
spin K3 -12
expect val3 +12_st
# Mod 2: breath to Noise at +60
tap SEL
tap SEL
expect view 7
spin K1 1
spin K2 5
expect val2 Noise
spin K3 60
expect par17 60
midi 90 39 64
breath 0 0 10
wait 50
expect noise 0
breath 0 127 50
wait 30
expect noise 60
expect level >5
shot noise_breath.png
# the knob adds to it
tap HOME
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 2
spin K1 30
expect par56 30
wait 30
expect noise 90
midi 80 39 00
breath 127 0 20
wait 400
expect gate 0
